
===== 1. ORCA outputs -> sticks (one imaginary mode weaker than 50 cm-1 is accepted and flagged) =====
9 molecules -> data/dft_sticks/calibration_gas/{activity,int785,gapiso785}/  (+ modes/, smiles_map.json)
accept phenylalanine: one soft imaginary mode (-7.9 cm-1), flagged
20 molecules -> data/dft_sticks/neutral_gas/{activity,int785,gapiso785}/  (+ modes/, smiles_map.json)
skip _old: unknown molecule
accept asparagine: one soft imaginary mode (-13.5 cm-1), flagged
20 molecules -> data/dft_sticks/neutral_water/{activity,int785,gapiso785}/  (+ modes/, smiles_map.json)
20 molecules -> data/dft_sticks/zwitterion_water/{activity,int785,gapiso785}/  (+ modes/, smiles_map.json)
frequency scale (your DFT -> QM9S): 0.967  median |error| 2.0 cm-1 over 58 matched strong bands
intensity convention activity : Spearman rho with QM9S = 0.956 over 88 bands
intensity convention int785   : Spearman rho with QM9S = 0.760 over 90 bands

